{"resource":"lines/maint-of-building-supplies-system","about":"One budget line, every year and stage a document states it.","count":6,"caveats":["A STAGE IS NOT A PERIOD. There is no join between this table and `ledger_snapshot` and nothing should invent one.","An \"actual\" here is a RESTATEMENT: a prior year re-presented by the people who spent it, inside the argument for the next budget. It is not a ledger figure.","These lines do NOT sum back to the district totals -- between 0.1% and 1.6% out. Never apportion a total across them.","`documents_disagree` marks a figure two documents state differently. The documents disagree with themselves by up to 1.5%, which is larger than most variances anybody wants to measure.","FY2021 is unusable: 117 of 120 lines print the budget under an \"actual\" heading. Exclude it."],"provenance":{"documents":[{"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-maintenance-budget.txt","path":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-maintenance-budget.txt","basis":"both","url":null,"copy_state":null,"sha256":"cc16389e237c6075bcff74891d5eee5d050809e70d36606aa6e5cf18f55e219e","cited_as":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-maintenance-budget.txt"}],"count":1},"rows":[{"line_key":"maint of building supplies system","label":"Maint. of Building Supplies/System","fy":2014,"stage":"actual","value":45484.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-maintenance-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"maint of building supplies system","label":"Maint. of Building Supplies/System","fy":2015,"stage":"actual","value":57916.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-maintenance-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"maint of building supplies system","label":"Maint. of Building Supplies/System","fy":2016,"stage":"actual","value":46757.0,"documents_disagree":0,"doc_id":"sources/district-budget-page/text/fy19-proposed-maintenance-budget.txt"},{"line_key":"maint of building s